  "title": "India-Egypt Trade Deal and Fintech Collaboration",
  "summary": "Piyush Goyal, India's Commerce and Industry Minister, co-chaired the India-Egypt Joint Trade Committee (JTC) and urged Egypt to facilitate startups and fintechs in a proposed trade pact. The talks focus on enhancing cross-border collaboration through payment systems, government procurement, and digital innovation.",
